title: "FORA: A browser-based platform for UAV-LiDAR forest point cloud analysis"
abstract: >-
  FORA (FORest Analysis) is an open-source, fully browser-based platform for
  processing UAV-LiDAR point clouds. It runs entirely client-side with no
  installation or server, supporting individual tree detection (CHM-based
  segmentation with variable window size), area-based metrics, species-specific
  allometric and biomass models, external DTM normalization, and vertical
  transect profiling.
